WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
Import a safe, generated video into the local media queue.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:13.700
Add on-media text and preview the vertical composition.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.000
Trim the eight-second source to the range 1–6 seconds.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Prepare a title, description, hashtags, and tags.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Export the five-second composition locally as an MP4.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.833
Export complete. The queue retains the edited item and metadata.
No external publishing is performed.

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:41.833
Actual downloaded local export: five seconds of the finished composition.